        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "A decent sized pool with a large waterslide and a small waterslide. It also has a wave pool for babies and toddlers that goes to knee length in depth on an adult. It’s fairly clean and is free entry to all citizens of the city.\n\nNo food is allowed on site and change area is fairly small.\n\nWater is decent temperature. The large pool is cooler than the wave pool. The wave pool is significantly warmer, which is a bonus for kids who are timid to go into the colder pool.\n\nOverall, it’s a great place to go with the family.",
        "time": 1753398081,
        "translated": false
      },
